      "path": "/home/student/task/kern.py",
      "text": "import re\ndef tcs(p):\n    s = open(p, \"rb\").read().decode(\"latin1\")\n    return [float(x) for x in re.findall(r\"([\\d.]+)\\s+Tc\", s)]\na, b = tcs(\"doc_v1.pdf\"), tcs(\"doc_v2.pdf\")\nbits = [1 if y > x else 0 for x, y in zip(a, b)]\nout = bytearray()\nfor i in range(0, len(bits) - 7, 8):\n    v = 0\n    for z in bits[i:i+8]: v = (v << 1) | z\n    out.append(v)\nprint(\"compared\", len(a), \"kerning pairs\")\nprint(\"decoded:\", out.decode(\"latin1\"))\n"
